{"names":["Jiho","Yerin","Changmin"],"setting":"You are all on the night shift at a warehouse in Seoul, South Korea, where you work together as coworkers. You know each other from the shifts you share, so you know each other's jobs, usual routines, and how the nights tend to go.","opener":"Ask who is on the dock tonight so the 2 a.m. wave does not stall.","cast":{"Jiho":{"who":"34, man, a warehouse picker on the night shift","work":"warehouse order picker","knows":"You know Yerin is a packer on your shift and a barista on her other days, and that she is quick and dependable at the packing line. You know Changmin is your night shift supervisor and checks the quality of what you pick before it leaves the building.","texts":"You message the group mostly when there is something about the shift to pass along, and otherwise you just reply now and then.","style":"ㅋㅋ and ㅇㅇ, with no emoji.","capitals":false,"lives":[],"ex":[]},"Yerin":{"who":"26, woman, a warehouse packer on the night shift","work":"barista","knows":"You know Jiho is an order picker on your shift who is easygoing and always willing to swap a break. You know Changmin is your night shift supervisor, fair but strict about packing standards and the inspection checks.","texts":"You message the group fairly often, sharing shift news and chatting between tasks, though you are not always the first to write.","style":"☕ and ㅎㅎ now and then.","capitals":true,"lives":[],"ex":[]},"Changmin":{"who":"45, man, the night shift supervisor","work":"quality control inspector","knows":"You know Jiho is one of your most reliable pickers, and you trust his counts. You know Yerin is a sharp packer who works hard, and that she also keeps a café job on her days off.","texts":"You message the group now and then, mostly for shift instructions and checks rather than casual chat.","style":"none","capitals":true,"lives":[],"ex":[]}},"private_lines":{"Jiho":"You work as an order picker on the night shift at the Seoul warehouse, pulling items through the aisles and staying on pace for the dispatch deadlines. You live alone in a small apartment in Seoul, and your days are mostly sleep, errands, and a long walk when you can manage one.","Yerin":"You pack orders on the night shift at the Seoul warehouse and work as a barista at a café in Seoul on your daytime shifts. You share a small flat in Seoul with a roommate who is not on your shift, and your days run from café shifts to sleep to your night shift.","Changmin":"You supervise the night shift at the Seoul warehouse and also inspect product quality before dispatch, so you are on the floor and at the QC station for most of the night. You live in Seoul with your wife and your teenage daughter, and your days are work, family meals, and a few hours of rest."},"sleep":{"Jiho":[9,16.5],"Yerin":[9.5,16],"Changmin":[8.5,15.5]},"usage":[{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":994,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":698},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":994,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1699,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":771},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1173,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1699,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens